  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_028) outperforms pca_n2000, but the impact of image encoder choice (resnet50 vs. imagenet_vit_l) remains unclear. This experiment tests the same RNA encoder with a different image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) in a singleprofile multimodal setup, isolating the effect of image representation. It directly compares the critical design choice of image encoder while keeping RNA encoder and fusion strategy consistent, providing clarity on whether the image modality's contribution is encoder-dependent."
}

